{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二萬一十九言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一卷戒本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大調伏藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此罪須除"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此惡須滅"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此犯須障，障謂遮障也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從「和合僧集會乃至答云說戒羯磨」是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從「大\n德僧聽」已下是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "從「諸大德我今欲說」已下是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是應來者來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "且言與欲，理實并與清淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清淨\n比丘雖來赴集，不肯同法法即不成。今既肯同，即是應得\n呵者不呵也。若不清淨，縱不肯同，體非僧故，雖呵不破法\n事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂布薩羯磨等應和，即是應來者來也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是應呵\n者不呵也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是應與欲者與欲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即是應來者來之差\n別也。此人自未解法，如新受戒信和上等來赴集也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前默\n然住即是後來。今此即顯先來之人，義雖\n差別其體不殊，以體同是應呵不呵故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：已集"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答云：\n和合"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若有令出，出已答云：已出。若無，應直答云：此處無未受具戒者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說訖，答云：說欲已。若無，應答云：此處無說欲人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "答法同前。今說\n戒時令說戒師連此三法合為一，問答中但答未受戒者\n已出等。計理得成，以先行籌表白，眾情已委和合僧集，\n不同羯磨之前不行籌等故須別問"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "黑月\n隨稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有罪必須懺訖聽戒。於罪若疑，發露已聽。若無罪者，但應默然也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "儻於說戒之前五德舉問，及說戒時戒師三問，並名他問。其有罪者，懺露同前。若無罪者，雖\n稱無罪而默不懺，亦是默義，亦得名為亦如是答也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此上\n二種初篇具有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "離衣宿及闕衣鉢不受持等是匱乏過，長衣鉢不\n作淨施是不喜足過失"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非親里尼取衣與衣、共獨坐等、輒教期行等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二入聚落乞美食過三鉢，跳行入白衣舍及坐等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畜寶販賣、營造二房及五敷具等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故漏、摩觸、媒等染著欲塵，勸織\n乞衣等染著衣服也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二謗兩舌異語嫌罵等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論中擔毛上樹過人等，今詳離衣鉢等亦是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "破僧出血等邪定聚故障往善趣，若惡性不受語障沙門行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二敷坐脫等，應護不護；牽驅等，不應護而護"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "阿利吒沙彌說欲不障道，\n不應為依；二法攝弟子等，應與為依"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不攝耳聽不行弟子法等，應敬不敬也；隨舉比丘，不應敬而敬也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說他麁罪，應覆不覆也；覆麁罪等，不應覆而覆也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "淨衣鉢等\n而不受用，而反受用捨墮財等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "愚心闇教，墮在犯中，迷為不犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "邪心說法得財利等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諂附福人方便取財"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "苦切侵欺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恒規侵削"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "倒易物籌決令屬己"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "劫味之類"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因寄侵隱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "伺他慢藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因官勢取"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一通用，隨所須用；二通畜，如已人未分物等。三共畜，同利未分也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三寶處等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "可則而行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善能調化"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "希聞頂戴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "深心印順"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "好行好果惡行惡果"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三十五事，如呵責犍度有其七五。且第一五，一不得授\n人大戒、二不得受依止、三不得受沙彌、四不得受差教誡尼、五設差不得往。如是等廣如律說也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《善見論》文更有異釋，不能繁敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂犯多罪，半知日數、半即不知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不暇廣敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "聖優婆夷得不壞信，名為住信"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乃至"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "罪處所法，如律滅諍犍度廣辨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如畜五長"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如二離衣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如取尼衣浣衣擔毛\n擗毛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如乞衣一居士，二居士勸增價織"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "過分索衣奪衣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "過知足，販五敷二寶、乞鉢乞縷、雨衣急施\n過前迴僧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂此不得即坐直還，故轉付彼親友比丘，親友比丘逕宿方還"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂畜心相次續"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今詳畜意，擬作三衣可待足竟。畜意不擬為作三衣，何須待足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此十罪中，或具一二\n等，隨事懺之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已上論文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若是小者除其禮足"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二三段等准此稱之。若物全多不可分別，得言眾多；\n若但可知，即須稱數。若是匹段，須言長財"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下九日染犯者不須此言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或二三等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或財"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "取不同犯者，如前已辨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或憶數，隨一二等數稱之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或隨數稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或隨數稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或隨數稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "犯者答言"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "《祇律》云頂戴持，亦好"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "更不須請懺主，前已請訖故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或財"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或隨數稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或隨數稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "廣說同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "取不同犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或捨與餘人，應言已捨與甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "對二三人\n及僧捨懺，事稍繁難故不敘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無罪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "己上請詞要須解意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准論此一攝入前法中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "計理詞句即初文是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准此即是說淨詞句。故《薩婆多論》云「說淨已，然後入\n眾悔過。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二三等准數稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二三等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂應法時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如飢渴等自是尋常名為主病"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "真諦云：蘇等無病服，犯非時食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南山律師云：今有愚夫，非時\n忘噉乾地黃茯苓末等，非但醎苦格口並出自心，不如噉飯。今詳，大謬判也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "茶葉之類即是非時漿也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "除蓮華等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂失本味等也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂非時中過須臾，准《僧祇》失受也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生飲者不須煮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是且記識法，謂待清當如法受"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。若有淨人，隨時數數\n手受而飲，不勞此法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂脂除滓，油等亦然"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。南山律師准《磨得\n勒伽論》安淨地內七日來服。今詳彼論，下之三藥並遮內宿故，《四分律》中盡形壽藥聽內宿，故知不同彼論也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二說。餘分准此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "餘詞同上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即不受過生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂一切障一切覆也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即一切覆多障也，謂三邊有障也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即一切障半覆也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即一切障多覆也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂一邊有壁也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前云古律更加一句錯者，即此是也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律本有此句者，錯也。此句成室，今落在此不成之中，以其同前四成室中第三室故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此辨第二三訖"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是出法之文\n也。具足應言：「長老！我今日受其坊里巷張家檀越請。我應往彼，今布施汝。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或小"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或黑月"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二三日等准數念之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂沙彌於我不悋此食也。施與大比丘，亦准此說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂作食彼沙彌等食想也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "乙丑等准知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甲子等准知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "甲子等准知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "子丑等時木影長短隨時稱之，一二夏等亦准稱之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中分後分亦准稱之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若闕者，應云：僧伽梨、欝多羅僧已具，安多會未具，我當具。餘衣及鉢隨闕稱之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若未受持，隨未持者云：僧伽梨未受持，我當受持。餘可准知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若一二段未說\n淨者，云：某衣未說淨，我當說淨，餘衣已說淨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或有別眾食緣，應云：我有\n病緣，應別眾食。餘緣准此稱之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若有病緣，\n應云：我今有病當療治"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "稠粥初出釜時，以草畫之不合者，亦飯攝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說此語已，授與前人。此中文意謂令前人知解我意，與我取此，食噉少許已，餘留作\n殘也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又有文言「我止，汝取食之。」七日藥戒律文云「應語言：止汝貪食。」"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如數息觀等，緣實息風等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不淨觀等，假想生人作死屍解也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或展轉淨施主"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三說。展轉\n淨施主，准知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二三段等准稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律中不言三說，故知一說即成也。此文是衣犍度文，勝於戒本相釋中\n文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已下"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或隨數稱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "准律教人與不犯也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "下謂罪中極下也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀未來亦爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上發諍戒，道理悉在此中明之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或翻此告"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說戒犍度是那那由比丘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "說戒犍度惡心蘭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "亦准說戒犍度"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若更有餘佛法者，示餘佛略也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "終"}
